WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:34.765 --> 00:00:40.685
Today we are learning English with
Disney’s classic animation Hercules!

00:00:40.685 --> 00:00:45.896
If you are interested in Greek mythology
as well as in inspiring adventures,

00:00:45.896 --> 00:00:49.233
let’s embark on this epic journey together!

00:00:49.233 --> 00:00:53.786
In case you are new here, the scenes
we’ve chosen have NO spoilers.

00:00:53.786 --> 00:00:57.780
You’ll watch two scenes from the
 movie, learn the vocabulary

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:01.907
and then have the chance to watch it
again without the subtitles.

00:01:01.907 --> 00:01:07.299
And, if you want to keep learning with
the best Disney movies and TV series

00:01:07.299 --> 00:01:14.374
so you can finally watch them without getting lost,
without missing the jokes, and without subtitles,

00:01:14.374 --> 00:01:18.000
just click on the subscribe button
and bell down below.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:22.086
That’s what Diana did and she has
seen a massive improvement

00:01:22.086 --> 00:01:26.760
not only in her pronunciation but
also her vocabulary!

00:06:03.474 --> 00:06:08.031
Speaking of success, if you want to
become a successful English learner,

00:06:08.031 --> 00:06:15.014
I highly recommend our FwF course! You’ll
have fun learning lots of native vocabulary,

00:06:15.014 --> 00:06:19.677
expressions and pronunciation
with the first 2 seasons of Friends.

00:06:19.677 --> 00:06:23.683
 You’ll receive PDF power lessons
every week and gain access

00:06:23.683 --> 00:06:29.664
to our Fluency Circle global community so
that you’re never alone on your journey!

00:06:29.664 --> 00:06:34.460
The best part is you can try it for
free with our 3 part masterclass!

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:37.876
Just click up here or in the link
down in the description box below

00:06:37.876 --> 00:06:40.666
I will send it straight to your email.

